  "_comment": [
    "Element sequences of the Austrian Post ShippingService, extracted from the carrier WSDL.",
    "These are WCF DataContract types: the xs:sequence is ordinal-alphabetical and the",
    "deserializer walks it STRICTLY forward, so an element sent out of order is silently",
    "dropped - no SOAP fault, no errorMessage, the label is still returned.",
    "Regenerate with:",
    "  curl -s 'https://abn-plc.post.at/DataService/Post.Webservice/ShippingService.svc?singleWsdl' \\",
    "    | python3 -c \"...\"   # see test_austrian_post_payload.py"
